# sidecar
kz-plan-sidecar 2
generator tool=kz-static tool_sha256=<sha256> tool_source=<sha256> core_source=<sha256>
input facts sha256=<sha256> path=<path>
input framework-layer-data sha256=<sha256> path=<path>
input namespace-data sha256=<sha256> path=<path>
input namespace-data sha256=<sha256> path=<path>
facts-artifact <sha256>
rules plan rules revision 4 (2026-11-18): manifest revision 4 (kzs-sites 4), the path A control selection, value requests, the wait rule and the object rules; both handling labels on the row line, the key-clearing calls as object-delete sites, the event sends of the other outcomes apart; relations rules revision 12 (2026-11-18)
manifest-revision 4 (kzs-sites 4)
plan-id <plan-id>
selection observation-set: every row of the relations (method document 3.1, the revised rule: no label and no proof of a row removes it)
priority method-priority: method priority port revision 1 (2026-11-16): label, order class, reach mark and disposition of the method document's S1 rule over the row text; tier 1 = disposition D07 (label R or J, counterpart, order class RELOC), tier 2 = the other rows of order class RELOC, tier 3 = the rest; within a tier the order of the relations text
classes rows 5 tier1 2 tier2 3 tier3 0
budget value=all reason="the test budget" disclosure="none given" planned=5 truncation=0 rows cut (row lines with state cut) unresolved="none" sensitivity="not measured"
control control selection rule revision 1 (2026-11-16): (a) path A rows with a probe-create handling line, (b) path A rows with a creator site (creator lines and not-a-pair lines of key constants), (a) then (b) in the order of the relations text; planned apart from the tier order (docs/plan_manifest.md section 7)
control-budget value=all reason="the test control budget" rows=5 (a 0, b 5) planned=5 cut=0 complete=yes unresolved="whether the control rows fit the record pool (no event volume measured)" sensitivity="not measured"
requests sha256=<sha256> file=plan.req rows=2 requests=6 planned=4
